<title>HONG KONG: Trade in China Travel shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in China Travel shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of China Travel International Investment Hong Kong Ltd was suspended at the company's request in the afternoon pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock exchange said on Monday.</p>
</text>
